<title>POLAND: Exbud wins PLN 27 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Exbud wins PLN 27 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction company Exbud Warszawa SA, 100-percent owned by Exbud SA, signed a deal worth 27 million zlotys to build a settlement in Warsaw, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the work would be completed in two years.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
